WEBVTT

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:32.365
Moderni se automobili rijetko kada pokvare

00:17:32.365 --> 00:17:35.148
Zašto je to tako? 
Zašto auti rade tako dobro?

00:17:35.148 --> 00:17:37.652
To nije zbog genijalnosti Henryja Forda

00:17:37.652 --> 00:17:40.743
Karla Benza ili Elona Muska.

00:17:40.743 --> 00:17:42.885
Nago zato što su moderni automobili

00:17:42.885 --> 00:17:47.919
proizvod više od sto godina rada

00:17:47.919 --> 00:17:49.509
stotina i tisuća

00:17:49.509 --> 00:17:50.845
pa i desetaka tisuća ljudi.

00:17:50.845 --> 00:17:52.956
Moderni je automobil proizvod

00:17:52.956 --> 00:17:55.745
zajedničkog rada, znanja i iskustva

00:17:55.745 --> 00:17:58.092
svakog muškarca i žene koji je ikad radio

00:17:58.092 --> 00:17:59.700
na autu,

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:02.615
a pouzdanost tehnologije rezultat je